  "body_text": "Agriculture & Agroecology\nGenomic Solutions to Support the Ecological TransitionGenomic approaches provide powerful tools to better understand agricultural ecosystems, develop innovative breeding strategies and assess the environmental impact of human activities.LDgenX supports public and private stakeholders in research, environmental monitoring and innovation projects through tailored genomic solutions.\n            Applications\n        \n        Plant breeding and genetic improvement\nDevelopment of molecular markers\nSoil microbiome analysis\nAgricultural biodiversity monitoring\nSoil health assessment\nEnvironmental metagenomics\nCandidate genes discovery \nDevelopment of marker-assisted breeding programs\n\n            Related Services\n        \n                 Environmental DNA \n            \n                Bioinformatics        \n            \n                Seqeuncing & dPCR               \n            \n                Microbial Community analyses\n            \n                Genomic Selection\n            \n            Case Studies\n        \n        Analysis of agricultural soil microbiomes\n    \n        Development of targeted dPCR assays\n    \n        Development of genetic markers for breeding\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
  "metadata_path": "source/en/applications__agriculture-agroecology.json"
